       "text": "Rack up points, earn extra lives, beat the clock, and climb the local rankings in a mode inspired by the golden age of arcade brawlers.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added new “Save Slot” system",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Choose from 3 different save slots for your new game or continuing your progress",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added temporary “Online Save” that can be copied to a Save Slot to resume progression from your last Online game",
